{"meta": {"notice": "No API key, so this request shares one free daily budget ($0.10) with everyone on your network's IP address. Get a free key with its own $1/day at https://openalex.org/settings/api and add api_key=YOUR_KEY to your requests. An AI agent can get one for its user in one call: POST https://api.openalex.org/api-keys with {\"email\": \"<your user's email>\"}; we email them a link, and the key works once they click it. Docs for agents: https://help.openalex.org/llms.txt", "count": 11959, "db_response_time_ms": 169, "page": 1, "per_page": 20, "groups_count": null, "x_query": {"oql": "get works with (国有企业 治理 控制权) in the full text", "x_new_oql": "get works with (国有企业 治理 控制权) in the full text", "oqo": {"get_rows": "works", "filter_rows": [{"column_id": "fulltext.search", "value": "国有企业 治理 控制权", "operator": "has"}]}, "url": "/works?filter=fulltext.search:%E5%9B%BD%E6%9C%89%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9A %E6%B2%BB%E7%90%86 %E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%9D%83&per_page=20", "order": "best matches first", "order_default": true}, "cost_usd": 0.001}, "results": [{"id": "https://openalex.org/W2257955939", "doi": null, "title": "国有企业“内部人控制”的防范与治理--一个超产权论的视角", "publication_date": "2005-01-01", "authorships": [{"author_position": "first", "author": {"id": null, "display_name": "范春艳", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": false, "raw_author_name": "范春艳", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}, {"author_position": "last", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5083950790", "display_name": "尹杰", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": false, "raw_author_name": "尹杰", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}], "abstract_inverted_index": {"内部人控制现象是国有企业的一大特征.人们通常认为这是导致经济绩效低下的主要原因之一.本文通过对国有企业内部人控制现象的成因分析,从超产权论模型出发,在产权激励的同时,强调了竞争激励对于控制内部人控制现象及改善国有企业经营绩效的作用.": [0]}, "cited_by_count": 0, "primary_location": {"id": "mag:2257955939", "doi": null, "is_oa": false, "landing_page_url": "http://www.cqvip.com/QK/96439A/200511/20572822.html", "pdf_url": null, "source": {"id": "https://openalex.org/S4306544670", "display_name": "北方经贸", "issn_l": null, "issn": null, "is_oa": false, "is_in_doaj": false, "is_core": false, "listed_in": [], "host_organization": null, "host_organization_name": null, "host_organization_lineage": [], "host_organization_lineage_names": [], "type": "journal"}, "license": null, "license_id": null, "version": null, "is_accepted": false, "is_published": false, "raw_source_name": "北方经贸", "raw_type": null}}, {"id": "https://openalex.org/W1003041459", "doi": null, "title": "国有企业控制权机制中的“内部人控制”问题及解决思路", "publication_date": "2012-01-01", "authorships": [{"author_position": "first", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5040233775", "display_name": "于小喆", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": true, "raw_author_name": "于小喆", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}], "abstract_inverted_index": {"在我国政府放权让利、建立现代企业制度和改革创新的过程中，经营者同时也掌握了对国有企业的经营控制权，形成了转型国家特有的内部人控制。由于我国企业内外部治理机制不完善，内部人控制往往会转化为严重的内部人控制问题。本文从国有企业内部人控制问题产生的背景、表现及特点入手．探讨治理国有企业内部人控制问题及完善控制权激励机制的有效对策。": [0]}, "cited_by_count": 0, "primary_location": {"id": "mag:1003041459", "doi": null, "is_oa": false, "landing_page_url": "http://www.cqvip.com/QK/96682X/201211/44029567.html", "pdf_url": null, "source": {"id": "https://openalex.org/S4306558559", "display_name": "财政研究", "issn_l": null, "issn": null, "is_oa": false, "is_in_doaj": false, "is_core": false, "listed_in": [], "host_organization": null, "host_organization_name": null, "host_organization_lineage": [], "host_organization_lineage_names": [], "type": "journal"}, "license": null, "license_id": null, "version": null, "is_accepted": false, "is_published": false, "raw_source_name": "财政研究", "raw_type": null}}, {"id": "https://openalex.org/W1034151162", "doi": null, "title": "我国国有企业“内部人控制”机制分析", "publication_date": "2005-01-01", "authorships": [{"author_position": "first", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5051525983", "display_name": "郭玮", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": false, "raw_author_name": "郭玮", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}, {"author_position": "last", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5066181228", "display_name": "王世彤", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": false, "raw_author_name": "王世彤", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}], "abstract_inverted_index": {"将'内部人控制'仅仅看成一个问题是当前我国国有企业治理研究的一个误区.通过本论文的分析,我们可以看到,'内部人控制'制度首先有其存在的必然性,应从制度演进的本质上把握其存在的合理性,其次是看到这种由于效率而逐渐设计的内部人控制制度存在着负面效应.指出国有企业治理的任务不在于对'内部人控制'制度形式的彻底否定,而是采取积极有效的措施,包括有效的产权改革、完善国有企业内外部监督管理和规范信息披露,减弱'内部人控制'制度中的信息非对称性,限制其负面效应,引导其正面作用的发挥.": [0]}, "cited_by_count": 0, "primary_location": {"id": "mag:1034151162", "doi": null, "is_oa": false, "landing_page_url": "http://www.cqvip.com/QK/87703X/200503B/20732262.html", "pdf_url": null, "source": {"id": "https://openalex.org/S4306543978", "display_name": "内蒙古农业大学学报：社会科学版", "issn_l": null, "issn": null, "is_oa": false, "is_in_doaj": false, "is_core": false, "listed_in": [], "host_organization": null, "host_organization_name": null, "host_organization_lineage": [], "host_organization_lineage_names": [], "type": "journal"}, "license": null, "license_id": null, "version": null, "is_accepted": false, "is_published": false, "raw_source_name": "内蒙古农业大学学报：社会科学版", "raw_type": null}}, {"id": "https://openalex.org/W954197238", "doi": null, "title": "构建“全民所有制”的国有企业公司治理模式", "publication_date": "2013-01-01", "authorships": [{"author_position": "first", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5059504892", "display_name": "墙波", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": true, "raw_author_name": "墙波", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}], "abstract_inverted_index": {"国有企业治理困难是现代企业在所有权和控制权分离的情况下所面临的一个普遍治理问题。改革开放以来,国有企业公司治理取得了一定成就,现国企改革进入了＂深水区＂,针对其所反映出的问题和矛盾,构建了一种＂全民所有制＂的国有企业公司治理模式。": [0]}, "cited_by_count": 0, "primary_location": {"id": "mag:954197238", "doi": null, "is_oa": false, "landing_page_url": "http://www.cqvip.com/QK/71182X/201307/47214559.html", "pdf_url": null, "source": {"id": "https://openalex.org/S4306559113", "display_name": "重庆与世界：学术版", "issn_l": null, "issn": null, "is_oa": false, "is_in_doaj": false, "is_core": false, "listed_in": [], "host_organization": null, "host_organization_name": null, "host_organization_lineage": [], "host_organization_lineage_names": [], "type": "journal"}, "license": null, "license_id": null, "version": null, "is_accepted": false, "is_published": false, "raw_source_name": "重庆与世界：学术版", "raw_type": null}}, {"id": "https://openalex.org/W1198595403", "doi": null, "title": "试论国有企业的“内部人控制 ”问题", "publication_date": "2004-01-01", "authorships": [{"author_position": "first", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5059963621", "display_name": "隋锡灿", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": true, "raw_author_name": "隋锡灿", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}], "abstract_inverted_index": {"我国国有企业的改革正进入攻坚阶段.由于所有权和经营权的分离,使得国有企业的经营者与所有者之间产生了激励不相容和信息不对称问题,导致公司治理结构中形成了内部人控制问题,内部人控制又使国有企业生产效率低下,引发全社会整体福利的下降.要完善公司治理结构,加强企业制度创新,营造公平的竞争环境,必须控制和防范内部人控制.": [0]}, "cited_by_count": 0, "primary_location": {"id": "mag:1198595403", "doi": null, "is_oa": false, "landing_page_url": "http://www.cqvip.com/QK/81123X/200411/10764377.html", "pdf_url": null, "source": {"id": "https://openalex.org/S4306543376", "display_name": "会计之友", "issn_l": null, "issn": null, "is_oa": false, "is_in_doaj": false, "is_core": false, "listed_in": [], "host_organization": null, "host_organization_name": null, "host_organization_lineage": [], "host_organization_lineage_names": [], "type": "journal"}, "license": null, "license_id": null, "version": null, "is_accepted": false, "is_published": false, "raw_source_name": "会计之友", "raw_type": null}}, {"id": "https://openalex.org/W1035349145", "doi": null, "title": "国有企业“内部人控制”成因分析", "publication_date": "1997-01-01", "authorships": [{"author_position": "first", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5068004009", "display_name": "吴建辉", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": true, "raw_author_name": "吴建辉", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}], "abstract_inverted_index": {"中国国有企业的现存治理结构可以概括为“行政干预下的内部人控制”，而且与其他转轨经济国家（俄罗斯、东欧各国）中常见的“法律上的内部人控制”不同，我国国有企业中的“内部人控制’，主要是“事实上的内部人控制”。这种“事实上的内部人控制”局面是伴随着我国企业改革的逐步推进而逐渐形成的，导致这种局面的原因也必然是多方面的。有关人士对国有企业“内部人控制”的形成过程曾作过如下描述：“在国家所有者（代表）还没有进入企业并在企业内行使所有者职能的情况下，对企业实行‘自主经营、自负盈亏、自我发展、自我积累’的政策，推动厂长（经理）负责制。这实际上是将所有者的（部分或全部）决策权、收益权在缺乏制约的情况下，交给了": [0]}, "cited_by_count": 0, "primary_location": {"id": "mag:1035349145", "doi": null, "is_oa": false, "landing_page_url": "http://www.cqvip.com/QK/82665X/199706/671899089199706010.html", "pdf_url": null, "source": null, "license": null, "license_id": null, "version": null, "is_accepted": false, "is_published": false, "raw_source_name": null, "raw_type": null}}, {"id": "https://openalex.org/W1434144235", "doi": null, "title": "“内部人控制”问题的分析——完善我国国有企业治理结构的对策", "publication_date": "2002-01-01", "authorships": [{"author_position": "first", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5029772770", "display_name": "孙叔光", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": false, "raw_author_name": "孙叔光", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}, {"author_position": "last", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5035162991", "display_name": "刘春兰", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": false, "raw_author_name": "刘春兰", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}], "abstract_inverted_index": {"我国国有企业在转轨过程中出现了的内部人控制具有明显的事实特征,其产生的原因主要是国有企业产权单一,国有产权的所有者形同虚设,同时对经理人员的监管乏力,从而产生内部人控制问题.因此,解决内部人控制问题,是完善国有企业治理结构的重要课题.": [0]}, "cited_by_count": 0, "primary_location": {"id": "mag:1434144235", "doi": null, "is_oa": false, "landing_page_url": "http://www.cqvip.com/QK/91367X/200201/5858204.html", "pdf_url": null, "source": null, "license": null, "license_id": null, "version": null, "is_accepted": false, "is_published": false, "raw_source_name": null, "raw_type": null}}, {"id": "https://openalex.org/W1149745921", "doi": null, "title": "股权制、债权制与竞争——现代企业理论视角下国有企业三种改革方案的理论比", "publication_date": "2000-01-01", "authorships": [{"author_position": "first", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5005986676", "display_name": "辛曌", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": false, "raw_author_name": "辛曌", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}, {"author_position": "last", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5053898776", "display_name": "满志弘", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": false, "raw_author_name": "满志弘", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}], "abstract_inverted_index": {"本文把我国企业改革方案划分为三类，股权制方案、债权制方案和竞争论方案。认为在理解我国国有企业改革路径的现实选择上，不仅产权安排是内笺，同时外部竞争环境也是内生的，由此我们提出产权结构和竞争环境等变量是政府国有企业改革的内生变量，并用一个政府、国有企业及私有企业的三方博弈模型证明，由于超了一国范围的竞争环境的进一步加强，外部环境最终是外生的，即有不可控性，各种企业治理结构最终将由市场而不是政府来决定是否生存。国有企业唯一的出路是形成市场承认的有效企业治理结构。": [0]}, "cited_by_count": 0, "primary_location": {"id": "mag:1149745921", "doi": null, "is_oa": false, "landing_page_url": "http://www.cqvip.com/QK/97983X/200012/4874297.html", "pdf_url": null, "source": {"id": "https://openalex.org/S4306540863", "display_name": "上海经济研究", "issn_l": "1005-1309", "issn": ["1005-1309"], "is_oa": false, "is_in_doaj": false, "is_core": false, "listed_in": [], "host_organization": null, "host_organization_name": null, "host_organization_lineage": [], "host_organization_lineage_names": [], "type": "journal"}, "license": null, "license_id": null, "version": null, "is_accepted": false, "is_published": false, "raw_source_name": "上海经济研究", "raw_type": null}}, {"id": "https://openalex.org/W975643392", "doi": null, "title": "现阶段国有企业“内部人控制”问题研究", "publication_date": "2006-01-01", "authorships": [{"author_position": "first", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5019716473", "display_name": "罗曰镁", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": true, "raw_author_name": "罗曰镁", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}], "abstract_inverted_index": {"现阶段我国国有企业中由于所有权和经营权的分离，使得国有企业的经营者与所有者之间产生丁激励不相容和信息不对称问题，导致公司治理结构中出现了“内部人控制”问题。“内部人控制”又使国有企业生产效率低下，引发国有资产流失可能性增大等一系列问题，因此我们要研究和解决“内部人控制”问题。": [0]}, "cited_by_count": 0, "primary_location": {"id": "mag:975643392", "doi": null, "is_oa": false, "landing_page_url": "http://www.cqvip.com/QK/95786A/200609X/22851065.html", "pdf_url": null, "source": {"id": "https://openalex.org/S4306545665", "display_name": "商场现代化", "issn_l": null, "issn": null, "is_oa": false, "is_in_doaj": false, "is_core": false, "listed_in": [], "host_organization": null, "host_organization_name": null, "host_organization_lineage": [], "host_organization_lineage_names": [], "type": "journal"}, "license": null, "license_id": null, "version": null, "is_accepted": false, "is_published": false, "raw_source_name": "商场现代化", "raw_type": null}}, {"id": "https://openalex.org/W1026595764", "doi": null, "title": "产权、控制权和绩效：中国信托业公司治理阐释", "publication_date": "2007-01-01", "authorships": [{"author_position": "first", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5038805486", "display_name": "王天恩", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": true, "raw_author_name": "王天恩", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}], "abstract_inverted_index": {"信托投资公司股权结构中，一股独大的特征非常明显。因为目前信托投资公司一般是由地方政府出资建立的，地方政府往往委派官员作为信托投资公司的总经理和董事长，往往形成独揽大权的局面，董事会和监事会成了摆设。股权的过分集中导致了我国信托业的“内部人控制”问题。这与其他国有企业中存在的治理结构问题大同小异。信托投资公司加强公司治理的路径选择是：股权结构多元化，发展信托公司控制权市场；完善信息披露制度环境与实施机制；培育信托经理，建设信托经理人市场；引入独立董事，完善董事会结构；建立委托人的约束机制。": [0]}, "cited_by_count": 0, "primary_location": {"id": "mag:1026595764", "doi": null, "is_oa": false, "landing_page_url": "http://www.cqvip.com/QK/91329X/200701/24029775.html", "pdf_url": null, "source": {"id": "https://openalex.org/S4306547343", "display_name": "宁夏大学学报：人文社会科学版", "issn_l": null, "issn": null, "is_oa": false, "is_in_doaj": false, "is_core": false, "listed_in": [], "host_organization": null, "host_organization_name": null, "host_organization_lineage": [], "host_organization_lineage_names": [], "type": "journal"}, "license": null, "license_id": null, "version": null, "is_accepted": false, "is_published": false, "raw_source_name": "宁夏大学学报：人文社会科学版", "raw_type": null}}, {"id": "https://openalex.org/W934556732", "doi": null, "title": "国有企业“内部人控制”现象分析及解决对策", "publication_date": "2006-01-01", "authorships": [{"author_position": "first", "author": {"id": null, "display_name": "Wei Zhang", "orcid": "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-2065-2535", "observed_orcids": ["https://orcid.org/0000-0003-2065-2535"]}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": true, "raw_author_name": "Wei Zhang", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-2065-2535", "affiliations": []}], "abstract_inverted_index": {"“内部人控制”问题伴随着企业所有权与经营权相分离的过程而产生。近年来,随着国有企业改革的深入,企业“内部人控制”问题越来越引起社会各界的重视,本文试从企业“内部人控制”的现象和危害入手,分析“内部人控制”的形成原因,探讨治理国有企业“内部人控制”的政策建议。": [0]}, "cited_by_count": 0, "primary_location": {"id": "mag:934556732", "doi": null, "is_oa": false, "landing_page_url": "http://www.cqvip.com/QK/84342A/20069X/689787482200609069.html", "pdf_url": null, "source": {"id": "https://openalex.org/S4306551849", "display_name": "时代金融", "issn_l": null, "issn": null, "is_oa": false, "is_in_doaj": false, "is_core": false, "listed_in": [], "host_organization": null, "host_organization_name": null, "host_organization_lineage": [], "host_organization_lineage_names": [], "type": "journal"}, "license": null, "license_id": null, "version": null, "is_accepted": false, "is_published": false, "raw_source_name": "时代金融", "raw_type": null}}, {"id": "https://openalex.org/W940933517", "doi": null, "title": "剩余索取权虚化与国有企业公司治理——基于“清江体制”的研究", "publication_date": "2004-01-01", "authorships": [{"author_position": "first", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5027726184", "display_name": "徐涛", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": true, "raw_author_name": "徐涛", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}], "abstract_inverted_index": {"国有企业剩余索取权虚化的直接原因是剩余索取者在控制和行使剩余索取权的过程中的偷懒行为，根本原因在于国有企业的剩余索取者不能参与企业剩余的分配，缺乏足够的动因行使剩余索取权。国有企业的剩余索取权虚化是一个普遍现象。剩余索取权虚化在国有企业公司治理中主要体现为剩余控制权与剩余索取权配置严重失衡，导致对经营者的监督和约束机制软化。改进剩余索取权虚化的国有企业公司治理的重点是建立有效的监督和约束机制，“老三会”在国有企业公司治理中的作用举足轻重。": [0]}, "cited_by_count": 0, "primary_location": {"id": "mag:940933517", "doi": null, "is_oa": false, "landing_page_url": "http://www.cqvip.com/QK/95499X/200410/10751740.html", "pdf_url": null, "source": {"id": "https://openalex.org/S4306556525", "display_name": "管理世界", "issn_l": null, "issn": null, "is_oa": false, "is_in_doaj": false, "is_core": false, "listed_in": [], "host_organization": null, "host_organization_name": null, "host_organization_lineage": [], "host_organization_lineage_names": [], "type": "journal"}, "license": null, "license_id": null, "version": null, "is_accepted": false, "is_published": false, "raw_source_name": "管理世界", "raw_type": null}}, {"id": "https://openalex.org/W1606451554", "doi": null, "title": "混合所有制企业股权制衡机制研究——基于“鄂武商控制权之争”的案例解析", "publication_date": "2015-01-01", "authorships": [{"author_position": "first", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5083637029", "display_name": "郝云宏", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": false, "raw_author_name": "郝云宏", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}, {"author_position": "last", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5073706872", "display_name": "汪茜", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": false, "raw_author_name": "汪茜", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}], "abstract_inverted_index": {"混合所有制企业治理结构问题是当前中国深化国有企业改革，全面推进市场化所亟待解决的关键问题。伴随着民营资本与国有资本融合程度的不断加深．民营资本作为第二大股东力量的不断增强．如果不能有效权衡二者之间的股权关系就会直接导致控制权纷争，从而引发治理效率缺失。解决国有股权和民营股权的激励相容问题，需要我们明晰二者之间股权制衡的动因、路径以及形成的最终绩效。本文以股权分置改革后的“鄂武商”为案例，根据上市公司股权结构特征，借鉴股东关系理论。探讨上市公司民营第二大股东对国有第一大股东的制衡机理。研究结果表明。民营参股股东与国有控股股东进行适度控制权争夺是符合效率原则的市场化行为，其制衡动因受到股权性质、现金流权、股权比例等因素的影响。参股股东可以通过引入关系股东、争取董事会席位及运用法律制度等路径制衡大股东。本文从股权制衡的视角诠释了混合所有制企业中第二大股东的治理作用与治理机制．为化解当前国有控股企业中民营股东与国有股东的“控制权冲突”提供了必要的借鉴．": [0]}, "cited_by_count": 0, "primary_location": {"id": "mag:1606451554", "doi": null, "is_oa": false, "landing_page_url": "http://www.cqvip.com/QK/93800A/201503/663983782.html", "pdf_url": null, "source": {"id": "https://openalex.org/S2764641372", "display_name": "China Industrial Economy", "issn_l": null, "issn": null, "is_oa": false, "is_in_doaj": false, "is_core": false, "listed_in": [], "host_organization": null, "host_organization_name": null, "host_organization_lineage": [], "host_organization_lineage_names": [], "type": "journal"}, "license": null, "license_id": null, "version": null, "is_accepted": false, "is_published": false, "raw_source_name": "中国工业经济", "raw_type": null}}, {"id": "https://openalex.org/W2336935885", "doi": null, "title": "股权制衡、社会资本与家族企业控制权——基于雷士照明控制权争夺案例的研究", "publication_date": "2015-01-01", "authorships": [{"author_position": "first", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5053788148", "display_name": "安维东", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": true, "raw_author_name": "安维东", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}], "abstract_inverted_index": {"家族企业引入机构投资者是其社会化过程中的重要一步。以往研究大多认为机构投资者参与治理能够缓解代理问题，提高公司治理效率。本文通过对雷士照明控制权争夺案例的分析，发现在股权制衡下，机构投资者为改善企业的治理状况而采用引入战略投资者、更换管理团队、驱逐创始人股东等手段，却因为无法获得家族企业社会资本的支持而无法有效发挥治理效应。本文认为，在我国家族企业中，股权制衡情况下机构投资者与家族股东之间的利益博弈容易引发控制权争夺：由于我国家族企业中存在的社会资本控制链，机构投资者发挥其治理效应仍存在困难；应注重相关法律法规建设，保护外部投资者利益。": [0]}, "cited_by_count": 0, "primary_location": {"id": "mag:2336935885", "doi": null, "is_oa": false, "landing_page_url": "http://www.cqvip.com/QK/96449X/201508/665771415.html", "pdf_url": null, "source": {"id": "https://openalex.org/S4306543340", "display_name": "企业经济", "issn_l": null, "issn": null, "is_oa": false, "is_in_doaj": false, "is_core": false, "listed_in": [], "host_organization": null, "host_organization_name": null, "host_organization_lineage": [], "host_organization_lineage_names": [], "type": "journal"}, "license": null, "license_id": null, "version": null, "is_accepted": false, "is_published": false, "raw_source_name": "企业经济", "raw_type": null}}, {"id": "https://openalex.org/W975840803", "doi": null, "title": "治理环境、政府控制和控制权定价——基于中国证券市场的实证研究", "publication_date": "2008-01-01", "authorships": [{"author_position": "first", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5031210701", "display_name": "叶会", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": false, "raw_author_name": "叶会", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}, {"author_position": "last", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5011870023", "display_name": "李善民", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": false, "raw_author_name": "李善民", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}], "abstract_inverted_index": {"本文以我国上市公司2001-2004年间的经验数据为样本，实证分析了治理环境、政府控制对控制权交易定价的影响。研究发现，较好的治理环境会降低控制权的交易价格；对政府控制企业的控制权定价显著高于非政府控制的企业；股权制衡程度越高，对控制权的支付价格越低。进一步研究还表明，治理环境对控制权定价的负向作用在政府控制的企业中更为显著、影响更大。本文对理解转型经济中制度环境对公司治理的影响提供了有益视角。": [0]}, "cited_by_count": 0, "primary_location": {"id": "mag:975840803", "doi": null, "is_oa": false, "landing_page_url": "http://www.cqvip.com/QK/81584X/200805/28569286.html", "pdf_url": null, "source": {"id": "https://openalex.org/S4306545086", "display_name": "南开管理评论", "issn_l": null, "issn": null, "is_oa": false, "is_in_doaj": false, "is_core": false, "listed_in": [], "host_organization": null, "host_organization_name": null, "host_organization_lineage": [], "host_organization_lineage_names": [], "type": "journal"}, "license": null, "license_id": null, "version": null, "is_accepted": false, "is_published": false, "raw_source_name": "南开管理评论", "raw_type": null}}, {"id": "https://openalex.org/W2255460978", "doi": null, "title": "国美之鉴 “国美电器”企业控制权争夺大战启示录", "publication_date": "2010-01-01", "authorships": [{"author_position": "first", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5006693552", "display_name": "陈穗芳", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": true, "raw_author_name": "陈穗芳", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}], "abstract_inverted_index": {"上市公司“国美电器”大股东、潮商黄光裕与职业经理人陈晓有关公司“控制权”的争战。被媒体称为“中国企业进化史上的经典案例”、“世纪经典商战”。透过这一商战过程，世人不仅对上市公司的治理架构有了深入的了解，而且还能感受到我们这个国家法制的进步及社会人文精神的进步。对许多白手起家并处于转型期的潮商企业来说。“国美权利争战”，更是给企业家们提供了思考与启迪的生动教材。": [0]}, "cited_by_count": 0, "primary_location": {"id": "mag:2255460978", "doi": null, "is_oa": false, "landing_page_url": "http://www.cqvip.com/QK/89351X/201005/35688294.html", "pdf_url": null, "source": {"id": "https://openalex.org/S4306554347", "display_name": "潮商", "issn_l": null, "issn": null, "is_oa": false, "is_in_doaj": false, "is_core": false, "listed_in": [], "host_organization": null, "host_organization_name": null, "host_organization_lineage": [], "host_organization_lineage_names": [], "type": "journal"}, "license": null, "license_id": null, "version": null, "is_accepted": false, "is_published": false, "raw_source_name": "潮商", "raw_type": null}}, {"id": "https://openalex.org/W334948698", "doi": null, "title": "国有企业公司治理结构：问题、原因、对策", "publication_date": "2003-01-01", "authorships": [{"author_position": "first", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5042875142", "display_name": "王高社", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": true, "raw_author_name": "王高社", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}], "abstract_inverted_index": {"目前80%的国有大中型骨干企业已初步建立起公司治理结构,但其中很多尚未形成健全的制度安排和规范的运行,内部人控制现象仍十分严重.对此,必须继续深化改革,抓住国有产权这一关键环节,建立合理的国有产权委托代理结构,建立健全有中国特色的公司法人治理结构,从根本上解决公司治理结构存在的问题.": [0]}, "cited_by_count": 0, "primary_location": {"id": "mag:334948698", "doi": null, "is_oa": false, "landing_page_url": "http://www.cqvip.com/QK/82256X/200301/7492329.html", "pdf_url": null, "source": null, "license": null, "license_id": null, "version": null, "is_accepted": false, "is_published": false, "raw_source_name": null, "raw_type": null}}, {"id": "https://openalex.org/W4417454958", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.62836/jem.v2n6.0950", "title": "浅析国有集团化企业中混合所有制子企业财务管理问题及对策", "publication_date": "2025-12-16", "authorships": [{"author_position": "first", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5120842558", "display_name": "王丹丹", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [{"id": "https://openalex.org/I4210092055", "display_name": "Gezhouba Group (China)", "ror": "https://ror.org/00c6xam17", "country_code": "CN", "type": "company", "lineage": ["https://openalex.org/I4210092055"]}], "countries": ["CN"], "is_corresponding": true, "raw_author_name": "王丹丹", "raw_affiliation_strings": ["China Gezhouba Group Cement Co., Ltd. , Wuhan , Hubei"], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": [{"raw_affiliation_string": "China Gezhouba Group Cement Co., Ltd. , Wuhan , Hubei", "institution_ids": ["https://openalex.org/I4210092055"]}]}], "abstract_inverted_index": {"王丹丹": [0], "中国葛洲坝集团水泥有限公司，湖北武汉": [1], "摘要：随着国有企业混合所有制改革的持续深化，国有集团化企业通过设立混合所有制子企业，实现公有资本与非公有资本的优势互补，为企业发展注入新活力。然而，混合所有制子企业在财务管理实践中，受股权结构多元、管理理念差异、治理体系不兼容等因素影响，面临着财务管控缺位、目标冲突、信息滞后等问题，制约了企业整体效益提升与国有资产保值增值目标的实现。本文以国有集团化企业中混合所有制子企业为研究对象，首先阐述国有企业混合所有制改革的核心意义，进而系统分析混合所有制子企业在财务管理中存在的典型问题，最后从优化治理结构、构建制度体系、升级信息系统等方面提出针对性解决对策，以期为国有集团化企业规范混合所有制子企业财务管理，提升整体运营效率提供参考。": [2]}, "cited_by_count": 0, "primary_location": {"id": "doi:10.62836/jem.v2n6.0950", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.62836/jem.v2n6.0950", "is_oa": true, "landing_page_url": "https://doi.org/10.62836/jem.v2n6.0950", "pdf_url": "https://cn.sgsci.org/finance/article/download/950/759", "source": {"id": "https://openalex.org/S5407047772", "display_name": "环球经济与管理杂志", "issn_l": "3060-9003", "issn": ["3060-9003"], "is_oa": false, "is_in_doaj": false, "is_core": false, "listed_in": [], "host_organization": null, "host_organization_name": null, "host_organization_lineage": [], "host_organization_lineage_names": [], "type": "journal"}, "license": null, "license_id": null, "version": "publishedVersion", "is_accepted": true, "is_published": true, "raw_source_name": "环球经济与管理杂志", "raw_type": "journal-article"}}, {"id": "https://openalex.org/W998551933", "doi": null, "title": "职工剩余控制权:理论、实践及发展方向", "publication_date": "2012-01-01", "authorships": [{"author_position": "first", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5004721552", "display_name": "杨继国", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": false, "raw_author_name": "杨继国", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}, {"author_position": "last", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5000425852", "display_name": "童香英", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": false, "raw_author_name": "童香英", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}], "abstract_inverted_index": {"以“资本至上”为逻辑的主流企业治理模式无法解决监督者难题，因而理论上陷入悖论。实践上陷入困境，尤其我国国有企业的改革更是如此。非主流企业理论对这个问题进行了一些反思，提出了剩余控制权分享的理论，实践上更是出现了多种形式职工控制权模式，尽管没有取得理论共识．实践模式受制于已有理论的束缚。通过梳理已有理论和实践两方面文献，论证职工分享企业的控制权成为企业治理机制重要组成部分的必要性与可行性，并预言这是未来企业治理的发展方向。": [0]}, "cited_by_count": 0, "primary_location": {"id": "mag:998551933", "doi": null, "is_oa": false, "landing_page_url": "http://www.cqvip.com/QK/87651A/201201/48118428.html", "pdf_url": null, "source": {"id": "https://openalex.org/S2764539113", "display_name": "Journal of Fujian Jiangxia University", "issn_l": null, "issn": null, "is_oa": false, "is_in_doaj": false, "is_core": false, "listed_in": [], "host_organization": null, "host_organization_name": null, "host_organization_lineage": [], "host_organization_lineage_names": [], "type": "journal"}, "license": null, "license_id": null, "version": null, "is_accepted": false, "is_published": false, "raw_source_name": "福建江夏学院学报", "raw_type": null}}, {"id": "https://openalex.org/W944556433", "doi": null, "title": "观念冲突、企业家特质与民营企业控制权之争——基于雷士照明控制权之争的案例研究", "publication_date": "2015-01-01", "authorships": [{"author_position": "first", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5060493731", "display_name": "谭跃", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": false, "raw_author_name": "谭跃", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}, {"author_position": "last", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5045036235", "display_name": "王翔", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": false, "raw_author_name": "王翔", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}], "abstract_inverted_index": {"以往关于我国民营企业控制权之争的研究多关注的是冲突各方的博弈和公司治理结构问题,鲜有涉及到思想观念和文化的层面.文章通过雷士照明三次控制权之争的案例,首先剖析了冲突爆发的深层次原因--我国民营企业家的传统观念与源自西方的现代企业理论的观念冲突,利益需求的冲突则是观念冲突的外在表现;然后剖析了冲突中折射出的民营企业家观念性格、法规意识、文化知识、行为方式等会阻碍公司规范运营、科学管理的特质;最后就提高民营企业家综合素质、完善公司治理、妥善安置控制权提出了针对性的建议.": [0]}, "cited_by_count": 0, "primary_location": {"id": "mag:944556433", "doi": null, "is_oa": false, "landing_page_url": "http://www.cqvip.com/QK/81123X/201504/6635